ence is what the next 18 months  we got thousands of customers millions  of users and hundreds of thousands of  jobs into the system if you have to put  the patients as part of the goal in  terms of business it takes time to build  a foundation things that matter take  time so if you have a lot of patience if  you put as much patience into building  your business as God puts in to us I'm  just think about how much patience and  forgiveness he has and it helps us  become the individual that has a greater  relationship with him our businesses are  the same way it takes time it takes time  to build the relationship submit' takes  time to have your investments come to  fruition it takes time to understand the  mechanics so believe in yourself and  believe in your patients when you have a  lot of patience and passion and you  combine those two things you can create  a tremendous amount of abundance in your  life
 

